#: index.php:111
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Versi"

#: index.php:144 index.php:286
msgid "Create bootable USB drives the easy way"
msgstr "Cipta pemacu USB boot dengan cara mudah"

#: index.php:230
msgid "Change language:"
msgstr "Tukar bahasa:"

#: index.php:239
msgid "Want to improve this translation?"
msgstr "Ingin meningkatkan terjemahan ini?"

#: index.php:313
msgid ""
"Rufus is a utility that helps format and create bootable USB flash drives, "
"such as USB keys/pendrives, memory sticks, etc."
msgstr ""
"Rufus adalah utiliti yang membantu memformat dan mencipta pemacu kilat USB "
"boot, seperti pemacu pen/kekunci USB, kayu memori, dan lain-lain."

#: index.php:314
msgid "It can be especially useful for cases where:"
msgstr "Ia boleh menjadi amat berguna untuk kes di mana:"

#: index.php:316
msgid ""
"you need to create USB installation media from bootable ISOs (Windows, "
"Linux, UEFI, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"anda perlu mencipta media pemasangan USB dari ISO boot (Windows, Linux, "
"UEFI, etc.)"

#: index.php:317
msgid "you need to work on a system that doesn't have an OS installed"
msgstr "anda perlu bekerja pada sistem yang tidak mempunyai OS yang dipasang"

#: index.php:318
msgid "you need to flash a BIOS or other firmware from DOS"
msgstr ""
"anda perlu untuk 'flash' BIOS atau perisian tegar (firmware) lain dari DOS"

#: index.php:319
msgid "you want to run a low-level utility"
msgstr "anda mahu menjalankan utiliti peringkat rendah"

#: index.php:321
msgid "Despite its small size, Rufus provides everything you need!"
msgstr ""
"Walaupun saiznya kecil, Rufus memberikan segalanya yang anda perlukan!"

#: index.php:322
msgid ""
"A non exhaustive list of Rufus supported ISOs is also provided at the bottom"
" of this page."
msgstr ""
"Senarai tidak lengkap ISO yang disokong Rufus juga diberikan pada bawah "
"halaman ini."

