msgstr "Bahasa Disokong:"

#: index.php:426
msgid ""
"I will take this opportunity to express my gratitude to the translators who "
"made it possible for Rufus, as well as this webpage, to be translated in "
"various languages. If you find that you can use Rufus in your own language, "
"you should really thank them!"
msgstr ""
"Saya akan mengambil peluang ini untuk mengucapkan terima kasih saya kepada "
"penterjemah-penterjemah yang menjadikan kemungkinan untuk Rufus, dan juga "
"laman sesawang ini, untuk diterjemahkan ke pelbagai bahasa. Jika anda "
"mendapati yang anda boleh menggunakan Rufus dalam bahasa anda sendiri, anda "
"patut mengucapkan terima kasih kepada mereka!"

#: index.php:277 index.php:429
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Penggunaan"

#: index.php:430
msgid ""
"Download the executable and run it &ndash; no installation is necessary."
msgstr ""
"Muat turun 'executable' dan jalankannya &ndash; tiada pemasangan diperlukan."

#: index.php:431
msgid "The executable is digitally signed and the signature should state:"
msgstr ""
"'Executable' ditandatangani secara digital dan tandatangan perlu menyatakan:"

#: index.php:433
msgid "(v1.3.0 or later)"
msgstr "(v1.3.0 atau kemudian)"

#: index.php:434
msgid "(v1.2.0 or earlier)"
msgstr "(v1.2.0 atau sebelum)"

#: index.php:436
msgid "Notes on DOS support:"
msgstr "Nota untuk sokongan DOS:"

#: index.php:437
msgid ""
"If you create a DOS bootable drive and use a non-US keyboard, Rufus will "
"attempt to select a keyboard layout according to the locale of your system."
msgstr ""
"Jika anda mencipta pemacu boot USB dan menggunakan papan kekunci bukan US, "
"Rufus akan cuba memilih susun atur papan kekunci mengikut tempatan sistem "
"anda."

#: index.php:438
msgid "Notes on ISO Support:"
msgstr "Nota untuk Sokongan ISO:"

#: index.php:439
#, php-format
msgid ""
"All versions of Rufus since v1.1.0 allow the creation of a bootable USB from"
" an <a target=\"_blank\" %s>ISO image</a> (.iso)."
msgstr ""
"Semua versi Rufus dari v1.1.0 membenarkan pembuatan USB boot dari <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>ISO image</a> (.iso)."

#: index.php:440
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Creating an ISO image from a physical disc or from a set of files is very "
"easy to do however, through the use of a CD burning application, such as the"
" freely available <a target=\"_blank\" %s>InfraRecorder</a> or <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>CDBurnerXP</a>."
msgstr ""
"Mencipta imej ISO dari cakera fizikal atau dari set fail bagaimanapun sangat"
" mudah digunakan, melalui penggunaan aplikasi pembakaran CD, seperti <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>InfraRecorder</a> atau <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>CDBurnerXP</a> yang sedia ada percuma."

#: index.php:443
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)"
msgstr "Soalan Kerap Ditanya (FAQ)"

#. You are encouraged to add the translation for " (in English)." after
#. "HERE</a></b>" as the FAQ is only available in English
#: index.php:444
#, php-format
msgid "A Rufus FAQ is available <b><a target=\"_blank\" %s>HERE</a></b>."
msgstr ""
"FAQ Rufus tersedia <b><a target=\"_blank\" %s>DI SINI</a></b>. (dalam Bahasa"
" Inggeris)"

#: index.php:445
#, php-format
msgid ""
"To provide feedback, report a bug or request an enhancement, please use the "
"GitHub <a target=\"_blank\" %s>issue tracker</a>. Or you can <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>send an e-mail</a>."
msgstr ""
"Untuk memberikan maklum balas, melaporkan pepijat atau menuntut peningkatan,"
" sila gunakan <a target=\"_blank\" %s>penjejak isu</a> GitHub. Atau anda "
"boleh <a target=\"_blank\" %s>hantarkan e-mel</a>."

#: index.php:448
msgid "License"
msgstr "Lesen"

#: index.php:449
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>GNU General Public License (GPL) version 3</a> or "
"later."
msgstr ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>GNU General Public License (GPL) versi 3</a> atau "
"kemudian."

#: index.php:449
msgid ""
"You are free to distribute, modify or even sell the software, insofar as you"
" respect the GPLv3 license."
msgstr ""
"Anda bebas untuk mengedarkan, mengubah, malah menjual perisian, selama anda "
"menghormati lesen GPLv3."

#: index.php:450
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Rufus is produced in a 100%% transparent manner, from its <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>public source</a>, using a <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>MinGW32</a> environment."
msgstr ""
"Rufus dihasilkan dalam 100%% telus, dari <a target=\"_blank\" %s>sumber "
"awam</a>nya, menggunakan persekitaran <a target=\"_blank\" %s>MinGW32</a>."

#. You are encouraged to append the translation for "(in English)" after
#. "Changelog" as it is only available in English
#: index.php:453
msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "Log perubahan"

#: index.php:279 index.php:485
msgid "Source Code"
msgstr "Kod Sumber"

#: index.php:487
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can clone the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>git</a> repository "
"using:"
msgstr ""
"Secara alternatif, anda boleh mengklon repositori <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>git</a> menggunakan:"

#: index.php:489
#, php-format
msgid "For more information, see the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>GitHub project</a>."
msgstr "Untuk maklumat lanjut, lihat <a target=\"_blank\" %s>projek GitHub</a>."

#: index.php:490
msgid ""
"If you are a developer, you are very much encouraged to tinker with Rufus "
"and submit patches."
msgstr ""
"Jika anda adalah pembangun, anda sangat digalakkan untuk bekerjasama dengan "
"Rufus dan menghantar penampal (patch)."

#: index.php:280 index.php:493
msgid "Donations"
msgstr "Derma"

#: index.php:494
msgid ""
"Since I'm getting asked about this on regular basis, there is <b>no</b> "
"donation button on this page."
msgstr ""
"Selepas saya ditanya berkenaan ini secara tetap, saya menyatakan <b>tidak "
"ada</b> butang derma di halaman ini."

#: index.php:495
msgid ""
"The main reason is that I feel that the donation system doesn't actually "
"help software development and worse, can be guilt-inducing for users who "
"choose not to donate."
msgstr ""
"Sebab utama adalah saya merasakan yang sistem derma sebenarnya tidak "
"membantu pembangunan perisian dan yang lebih teruk, boleh mendorong rasa "
"bersalah bagi pengguna yang memilih untuk tidak menderma."

#: index.php:498
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If you really insist, you can always make a donation to the <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>Free Software Foundation</a>, as they are the main "
"reason software like Rufus is possible."
msgstr ""
"Jika anda hendak juga, anda boleh selalu memberikan sumbangan kepada <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>Free Software Foundation</a>, kerana mereka adalah "
"sebab utama yang perisian seperti Rufus adalah mungkin."

#: index.php:499
msgid ""
"At any rate, I'll take this opportunity to say <i><u>thank you</u></i> for "
"your continuing support and enthusiasm about this little program: it is much"
" appreciated!"
msgstr ""
"Apapun, saya akan mengambil kesempatan ini untuk mengucapkan <i><u>terima "
"kasih</u></i> atas sokongan berterusan dan galakan anda untuk perisian kecil"
" ini: ia sangat dihargai!"

#: index.php:500
msgid ""
"But please continue to feel free to use Rufus without any guilt about not "
"contributing for it financially &ndash; you should never have to!"
msgstr ""
"Tetapi sila teruskan untuk menggunakan Rufus tanpa rasa bersalah hanya "
"disebabkan tidak menyumbang untuk kewangannya &ndash; anda sepatutnya tidak "
"perlu melakukannya!"

#: index.php:503
msgid "Non exhaustive list of ISOs Rufus is known to work with"
msgstr "Senarai tidak lengkap ISO yang Rufus diketahui untuk berfungsi"

